Embed text through the selected provider.

Usage:
  printf '{"texts":["hello"]}' | strap embed --provider hash
  printf '{"texts":["hello"]}' | strap embed --provider openai
  printf '{"texts":["hello"]}' | strap embed --provider openrouter

`hash` is local and deterministic. Provider-backed embeddings are delegated through `strap provider <name> embed` when that provider supports embeddings.
